---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: caller invokes releaseVestedTokens(investor)
    q_check_vesting --> q_revert_no_vesting: position.vestingAddress == address(0)
    q_check_vesting --> q_call_release: position.vestingAddress != address(0)
    q_revert_no_vesting --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract
    q_call_release --> q_check_releasable: call vestingContract.release(askToken)
    q_check_releasable --> q_revert_nothing: releasable amount == 0
    q_check_releasable --> q_transfer: releasable amount > 0
    q_revert_nothing --> [*]: revert NothingToRelease
    q_transfer --> q_emit: vesting contract transfers releasable askToken to investor
    q_emit --> [*]: emit VestedTokensReleased(investor, releasedAmount)

    note right of q_call_release
        INV-001: Release follows predefined vesting schedule in the deployed vesting contract
        INV-002: Vesting contract is an independent clone with its own schedule
        INV-003: Anyone can trigger release on behalf of an investor
    end note
